	(text "12V Input -> Mini560 Buck #1 (5V) + Mini560 Buck #2 (3.3V)\nWith MOSFET-switched 12V rail for wind sensors (RS485)\nReverse polarity protection via 1N5819 Schottky diode"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120 25 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "41ef2893-5a3f-4d84-b7ba-aba3c50bd2b2")
	)
	(text "NOTES:\n1. Mini560 modules: jumper-select fixed voltage (5.0V / 3.3V). Verify with multimeter BEFORE connecting load.\n2. D1 (1N5819) provides reverse polarity protection. Forward drop ~0.3V @ 2A.\n3. Q1+Q2+R1+R2: Level-shifted P-ch MOSFET switch. GPIO15 HIGH = 12V_SW ON.\n4. All capacitors: electrolytic, observe polarity.\n5. J1: 2.1mm center-positive barrel jack. 12V 2A DC adapter for bench testing.\n6. Schematic generated by Hermes Agent via kicad-sch-api v0.5.6"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 -25 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "883bf813-9414-4e07-9d78-4ffe03154244")
	)
